  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you are going to keep removing components like VRIK's OnStep or  Legacy animations from people and continue limiting us tell the point where we are unable to create stuff anymore in a sandbox game. how about you at least use the rank system you just created in order to allow people who are trusted to be able to use them at least. you limiting everyone because of a small minority of people who keep creating accounts to troll or harass people. and its hurting everyone who plays your game. i have used many things that have been taken away causing me to remake avatars or redo them. but now that you taken away Legacy Animations its not possible to really replicate that anymore. this is very annoying and i'd wish you'd stop restricting us, the people who are creating content for other players and your game causing it to create its own life cycles. im sorry if this is very rant like, but im very upset with this keep happening every other update.",
